      "statement": "`docs dev` orchestrates development by: (1) optionally performing an initial full build via `build_command()`, (2) starting a `FileWatcher` monitoring `src/` for changes and triggering incremental rebuilds, and (3) launching the Mintlify dev server (`mint dev --port 3000`) in the `/build` directory with log forwarding, then continuing to watch until interrupted or a process exits abnormally.",
